<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{.Name}} — Build Cost — Spacemolt KB</title>
<style>
 body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:1rem;background:#0d1117;color:#c9d1d9}
 table{border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:1rem} th,td{border:1px solid #21262d;padding:.3rem .5rem;text-align:right}
 th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left} .infeasible{color:#6e7681} .pos{color:#3fb950} .neg{color:#f85149} a{color:#58a6ff}
 .legend{font-size:.8rem;color:#8b949e;max-width:70ch}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p><a href="../build-costs/">← Build Cost Matrix</a></p>
<h1>{{.Name}} <small>({{.Kind}})</small></h1>
<p>Build cost by station. BoM = from raw ore; Recipe = buy sub-assemblies.</p>

{{if .SelfHref}}<p><a href="{{.SelfHref}}">View {{.Name}} in the catalog →</a></p>{{end}}

<h2>Bill of Materials <small>(raw inputs)</small></h2>
{{if .BoM}}
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Material</th><th>Qty</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .BoM}}<tr><td>{{if .Href}}<a href="{{.Href}}">{{.Name}}</a>{{else}}{{.Name}}{{end}}</td><td>{{.Qty}}</td></tr>{{end}}
</tbody>
</table>
{{else}}<p class="infeasible">No bill of materials.</p>{{end}}

{{if .RecipeNA}}
<h2>Recipe</h2>
<p class="infeasible">{{.RecipeNA}}</p>
{{else if .Recipes}}
<h2>Recipe{{if gt (len .Recipes) 1}}s{{end}} <small>(sub-assemblies)</small></h2>
{{range .Recipes}}
<h3>{{.ID}} <small>yields {{.OutputQty}}</small></h3>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Input</th><th>Qty</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Inputs}}<tr><td>{{if .Href}}<a href="{{.Href}}">{{.Name}}</a>{{else}}{{.Name}}{{end}}</td><td>{{.Qty}}</td></tr>{{end}}
</tbody>
</table>
{{end}}
{{end}}

<h2>Build cost by station</h2>
<p class="legend"><strong>Savings</strong> = the finished item's cheapest <em>ask</em> at that station &minus; build cost (positive = building beats buying it outright). <strong>Profit</strong> = the station's best <em>bid</em> for the finished item &minus; build cost (positive = build-and-sell arbitrage). Both use the BoM cost and appear only when that build is feasible. Ships have an ask but no bid, so they show Savings only.</p>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Station</th><th>Empire</th><th>BoM cost</th><th>BoM Feasible</th><th>Recipe cost</th><th>Recipe Feasible</th><th>Recipe</th><th>Savings</th><th>Profit</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Lines}}
<tr>
 <td>{{.StationName}}</td><td>{{.Empire}}</td>
 <td class="{{if not .BoMFeasible}}infeasible{{end}}">{{.BoMCostStr}}</td>
 <td>{{.BoMCovered}}/{{.BoMTotal}}</td>
 <td class="{{if .RecipeNA}}infeasible{{else if not .RecipeFeasible}}infeasible{{end}}">{{.RecipeCostStr}}</td>
 <td>{{.RecipeFeasibleStr}}</td>
 <td>{{.RecipeID}}</td>
 <td class="{{.SavingsClass}}">{{.SavingsStr}}</td>
 <td class="{{.ProfitClass}}">{{.ProfitStr}}</td>
</tr>
{{end}}
</tbody>
</table>
</body>
</html>
